### TokenPay 测试请求

### 1. 获取 TokenPay 配置
GET http://localhost:3555/test/tokenpay/config

### 2. 测试创建订单（直接测试 TokenPay 接口）
### 默认 USDT_TRC20
GET http://localhost:3555/test/tokenpay/create

### 测试 EVM_ETH_USDT_ERC20
GET http://localhost:3555/test/tokenpay/create?currency=EVM_ETH_USDT_ERC20&amount=15.00

### 测试 USDT_ERC20 (旧格式)
GET http://localhost:3555/test/tokenpay/create?currency=USDT_ERC20&amount=10.00

### 3. 获取支付方式列表
GET http://localhost:3555/payments/methods

### 4. 正式创建 TokenPay 订单（需要JWT）
POST http://localhost:3555/payments/tokenpay/order
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_jwt_token_here

{
    "amount": 100000,
    "type": "channel",
    "dst_code": "USDT",
    "callback_url": "http://localhost:3000/wallet",
    "chain_type": "TRX"
}

### 5. 模拟 TokenPay 回调
POST http://localhost:3555/payments/tokenpay/notify
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "order_id": "TEST123456",
    "tx_hash": "0x1234567890abcdef",
    "amount": "10.00",
    "status": "paid",
    "chain": "TRX",
    "confirmations": 12,
    "timestamp": 1700000000
}

### 6. 登录获取JWT（用于测试）
POST http://localhost:3555/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser",
    "password": "password"
}
